{"4302850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Case 1963", "steam_appid": 4302850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302850/extras/e182f9bf84ee688eec9580d31e712d75.poster.avif?t=1777395505\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302850/extras/e182f9bf84ee688eec9580d31e712d75.webm?t=1777395505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302850/extras/e182f9bf84ee688eec9580d31e712d75.mp4?t=1777395505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Outsmart the Most Dangerous Criminal Gangs in 1960s England</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the heart of the 1960s, England was drowning in a surge of organized crime—<br>an era dominated by the <strong>Richardson Gang</strong>, the <strong>Italian Mafia</strong>, and the infamous <strong>Kray Twins</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Case 1963</strong> is a <strong>2D narrative-driven and educational experience</strong> that blends storytelling with challenging gameplay.<br>Step into the shoes of <strong>three unique characters</strong>, explore their distinct environments, uncover their motivations, and face puzzles and challenges that demand <strong>skill, strategy, and precision</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302850/extras/79a390e2927c849d323df409d36a1107.avif?t=1777395505\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302850/extras/c8536370e1322f8608e25a751f0d6b1